      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Rain slicks a jagged alliance of peeling murals and rotting mattresses, where harsh overhead lights flicker like dying neurons against walls stained by decades of abandoned violence. The street smells of stale beer and wet ash, while the silence of the alley breaks only when a low growl slithers from the bushes or the rhythmic thud of a door slamming shut too close to the window. Every flickering bulb seems to expose a hidden eye, and the shadows clinging to the brickwork look less like absence of light and more like the looming figures of the men who own this territory. It is a place where footsteps echo not on the ground, but on the shoulders of everyone else waiting for the next unnecessary blow.",
