    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a great vibe, very moody. I want to zoom in a bit more on the people to make it feel even more grounded. Can you describe what's happening on the corner? Like, what do the people hanging out there look like, what are they wearing, and what are they actually doing that makes a regular person feel like they shouldn't walk through there?",
